        {
          "text": " Kinera kaŋes kaituke, kaitebeikin, mere kakiro nuimunonoro; ido eanyuni ŋesi asima naka EJAKAIT: asa kanukinyo mam ipotu kokuriakarotor aluikin ekakejaanakinan Musa koinerekus?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
