              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Aaron Musa atiar, “Wu okwe ekaiakait, kenainait, sirikisibwok sio aronis, naarai kiswama nukabanaanut, kidiaka da. ",
